Done. Semantic hints have been injected across the whole app (WebTestBench_0001, a curated-products e-commerce demo) under `src/`.

**Screens/components annotated** (all 5 routed pages + shared components):
- **Layout**: `Header.tsx` (logo, desktop/mobile nav, search input, admin link, menu toggle), `Footer.tsx` (logo, category links, quick links)
- **Product primitives**: `ProductCard.tsx` (widened with an optional `collectionId` prop so item ids can be scoped per collection), `ProductGrid.tsx` (collection container + empty state), `ProductFilters.tsx` (search, category/sort/rating selects with `data-semtag-options` built from the same array that renders `<SelectItem>`s, price slider, tag toggles, clear action — all wired to a `controlsId`), `CategoryBadge.tsx` / `RatingStars.tsx` (widened with an optional `semtagId` prop, per the skill's one allowed prop-passthrough change)
- **Pages**: `Index.tsx` (hero nav, featured collection, category-browse collection, per-category "latest" collections), `ProductsPage.tsx`, `CategoryPage.tsx`, `ProductDetailPage.tsx` (detail fields, tags/specs collections, related-products collection), `AdminPage.tsx` (create/edit form, spec-row region, products collection with edit/delete actions), `NotFound.tsx`

**Id namespaces**: `nav.*`, `search.query[.mobile]`, `footer.*`, `home.*` (`home.hero`, `home.featured`, `home.categories`, `home.category.<id>`), `products.*`, `category.*`, `product.detail.*`, `product.notfound.*`, `product.related`, `filters.*`, `admin.*`, `notfound.*` — each repeated collection follows `<prefix>.item.<key>` keyed by product slug/id/tag/category, never array index.

**Collections that couldn't fold**: the admin spec-rows editor (`admin.form.specs`) is kept as a `region`, not a `collection` — new rows start with a blank label, so there's no stable domain key to fold on until the user types one; rows are addressed by 1-based position instead (documented inline).

**Left unhinted**: `NavLink.tsx` (dead code, never rendered) and all shadcn/ui primitives in `src/components/ui/*` beyond what's already exercised through prop passthrough (nothing decorative was tagged).

